# A ram with a spear in front of it: back on its heels, and then all of it, point first, through whatever is there.
clip charge
key 0    root -0.2      arm_r 0.6,0.05  arm_l 0.9,-0.1   grip -0.6   torso 0,0,0.6
key 0.6  root -0.42     arm_r 0.1,0.05  arm_l 0.5,-0.1   grip -0.1   torso 0,0,0.95  lift 0.02
key 1    root 0.62      arm_r 1.6,0     arm_l 1.6,-0.1   grip -1.6   torso 0,0,-0.4  lift 0.05
key 2    root 0.7       arm_r 1.6,0     arm_l 1.6,-0.1   grip -1.6   torso 0,0,-0.4  lift 0.05
key 2.5  root 0.35      arm_r 1.3,0.05  arm_l 1.4,0      grip -1.2   torso 0,0,-0.2
key 3    root 0         arm_r 0.9,0.15  arm_l 1.2,0.05   grip -0.75  torso 0,0,0
